enre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1082616, "client_id": 2521497, "nc": 129}, {"path": "/@kojiro_0408/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1082616, "client_id": 2273905, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/35e75474/uploads/origins/d2ca6730-81c3-4b23-8473-748eb9b06d29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56917407f0f9403cbc52fa113a566daf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/35e75474/uploads/origins/d2ca6730-81c3-4b23-8473-748eb9b06d29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56917407f0f9403cbc52fa113a566daf, https://si.imgix.net/35e75474/uploads/origins/d2ca6730-81c3-4b23-8473-748eb9b06d29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=989ce6bb7577cade9b7faff0f84c666c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/35e75474/uploads/origins/d2ca6730-81c3-4b23-8473-748eb9b06d29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ba3d1e25c6f576dbaa2af9709d467055 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/35e75474/uploads/origins/d2ca6730-81c3-4b23-8473-748eb9b06d29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9c777c43b5035f07ce388aae56bc5ac0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/35e75474/uploads/origins/d2ca6730-81c3-4b23-8473-748eb9b06d29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9c777c43b5035f07ce388aae56bc5ac0, https://si.imgix.net/35e75474/uploads/origins/d2ca6730-81c3-4b23-8473-748eb9b06d29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=88dc919eddb8d53a37faf9a5cc65f6f5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/35e75474/uploads/origins/d2ca6730-81c3-4b23-8473-748eb9b06d29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=01273fd00e9aa9ed1e91449ca5b979eb 3x"}, "body": "Hello, Mr. Shirato. My name is Rote (@roteinpu).\nThank you very much for your usual support.\n\nThis is my first time to make a request.\nI am very sorry if there are any flaws or rudeness.\nIn that case, please do not hesitate to reject my request.\n\nFirst of all, the purpose of this request is that we are planning to publish a book of Golden Kamui Koito Otonoshin's dream novels at an event in December or later.\nWe would like to use Mr. Shirato's beautiful drawings for the front and back covers of the book.\nOf course, we will mention Shirato-san's name clearly in the afterword column and when we advertise on Twitter.\n\nIf the purpose of using your artwork as the front and back cover of a fanzine is out of the question, we are very sorry.\nPlease reject this request.\n\nAlso, even in the unlikely event that the picture drawn by Mr. Shirato cannot be used as the cover due to the relationship with the printing house or some other reason, I would like to cherish and appreciate it as a treasure in my heart.\nNaturally, I will not raise any objections as stipulated in the terms and conditions.\n\nI would like to request the following two illustrations from Mr. Shirato.\nI would appreciate your consideration.\n\n(1) Color illustration of Ensign Otonoshin Koito from Golden Kamui\nPlease provide a picture of Ensign Koito with his upper body naked, smiling and holding out his hand to us (the dreamer or purchaser).\nPlease keep the upper half of the body naked.\nPlease leave no scratches on his cheeks.\nI love Shirato-san's two pictures of \"Fireworks and the Sea\" in his \"Summer and Kit (July 24, Twitter)\". I would be happy to see such an enchanting expression of love for the dreamer.\nI would be happy if there are tears at the corner of her eyes.\nI would be happy if her cheeks are slightly red.\nI am happy if her hair is a little disheveled because she woke up from sleep.\nI would like to see the dreamer's pale, thin arms, like in the \"Sea Picture\" of \"Summer and Kit\" above.\nThe background should be vaguely recognizable as being in a Japanese-style room from the Meiji era.\nI would appreciate it if the size of the picture could withstand the size of an A6 paperback book (148 x 105 mm), but I will leave this up to Mr. Shirato. As mentioned above, even if the cover cannot be used due to the relationship with the printer or other reasons, we will not raise any objections as per the terms of the agreement.\n\n\n(2) Color illustration of His Excellency Golden Kamui if matured Otonoshin Koito\nPlease draw a color illustration of His Excellency the Mature Carp, who has grown up to be in his 40s, dressed in a kimono and smiling as he holds out his hand to us (the dreamer/buyer).\nHe has scars on his cheeks, his hair is slicked back, his forehead is out, he has a mustache and beard, his muscles are big, and he is sexy and a little charming.\nI have seen a few of the mature Koito in the doujin community, but I would like to see a mature Koito drawn by Mr. Shirato.\nI would be happy to see a composition of him paired with Ensign Koito on the cover.\nI would like to see a pairing between Ensign Koito on the front cover and the matured Koito on the back cover.\nI would like to see the dreamer's pale arms on the front cover as well as on the back cover.\nI would like to have an image of the two of them strolling in a large garden in the Meiji era. I would like the background to be like that.\nI would appreciate it if the size of the cover could withstand A6 paperback size (148 x 105 mm), but I will leave that up to Mr. Shirato. As mentioned above, even if the cover cannot be used due to the relationship with the printer or other reasons, we will not raise any objections as stipulated in the terms and conditions.\n\n\nThe first time I got to know Mr. Shirato was through his Kinkamu pictures, but now I am a fan of his pictures themselves.\nI don't know about FGO, but I thought his drawing of Junaguda\u2640 on Twitter on August 9 was very beautiful and full of love between the two.\nIf I could publish a dream book with Shirato-san's drawings, nothing would make me happier.\n\nI apologize for the length of this message.\nPlease take care of yourself and don't get sick during the changing season.\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@kojiro_0408/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1082616, "client_id": 2191463, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0e7ffd4/uploads/origins/d6e8188b-6814-433b-b241-0a7ecf1f482f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ada10e1a1ddd671b41d1872ef7aecfe8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d0e7ffd4/uploads/origins/d6e8188b-6814-433b-b241-0a7ecf1f482f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ada10e1a1ddd671b41d1872ef7aecfe8, https://si.imgix.net/d0e7ffd4/uploads/origins/d6e8188b-6814-433b-b241-0a7ecf1f482f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f8c33c19d1541c1aa3d083528d3dbb3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d0e7ffd4/uploads/origins/d6e8188b-6814-433b-b241-0a7ecf1f482f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e47af4d4efbdedb708c31df7bd220c9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0e7ffd4/uploads/origins/d6e8188b-6814-433b-b241-0a7ecf1f482f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8128f544d93173199c95c38c74b3f11e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d0e7ffd4/uploads/origins/d6e8188b-6814-433b-b241-0a7ecf1f482f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8128f544d93173199c95c38c74b3f11e, https://si.imgix.net/d0e7ffd4/uploads/origins/d6e8188b-6814-433b-b241